# Outside needs no API keys: every upstream (NWS, SPC, RainViewer, Nominatim,
# Open-Meteo) is free and keyless. Open-Meteo's free tier is for
# non-commercial use only. Copy to .env.local only if you want to change these.

# Sent in the User-Agent to api.weather.gov and nominatim.openstreetmap.org,
# both of which ask for a way to reach whoever runs the client. A URL or an
# email address. Defaults to this project's GitHub page.
# OUTSIDE_CONTACT=https://github.com/tjones23/Outside
